--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
=== SUMMARY ===
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data sources : AutomationListPageViewModel binds shared S8 AutomationsStore.automations() (web useAutomations)
               via asAutomationListSource() as a typed List<Automation> cache-then-network StateFlow; the bulk
               action binds AutomationsStore.bulkAutomationsUpdate(ids, op) (web useBulkAutomationsUpdate). No
               HTTP in the view. Selection + in-flight op are ViewModel StateFlows; on a successful bulk op the
               selection clears and the shared store refreshes the list feed, which re-emits through state.
si/units     : the automation payload carries no unit-bearing fields (name, description, an execution count, an
               enabled flag) — round-trips verbatim, no SI conversion; the run count is locale-formatted at the
               render boundary (NumberFormat.getIntegerInstance(locale), S5).
a11y/theme   : shared components supply semantics content descriptions (bulk-bar + master/row checkboxes set
               contentDescription, EmptyState/ErrorDisplay built-ins), >=48dp targets (Material Checkbox/Button),
               dynamic-color + dark theme via MaterialTheme (A2 tokens); Compose-native (no webview). The table
               scrolls horizontally so all five columns stay legible on a phone.
nav          : Destinations 'automationList' -> /automations/list (pre-existing) wired to AutomationListRoute()
               via PageHosts.register; deep link auto-registered by TeslaSyncNavHost. Row/empty-CTA cross-route
               links are callback affordances (no-op under the current no-LocalNavController foundation) and are
               not manifest parity items.
